{
    "title": "Macadam - Walk And Earn",
    "description": "Discover Macadam, the revolutionary application that turns physical activity into real money. Whether you're taking a leisurely stroll or in the middle of a running workout, every step you take is converted into dollars.  \r\n\r\nMacadam is compatible with connected watches and uses your phone's step counter via Google Fit to track every step you take, every calorie you burn and every metre you walk. Looking for extra motivation to reach your fitness or weight loss goals? Then you've found it.\r\n\r\nWith Macadam, you're not just active, you're rewarded. Every step earns you 'coins', our virtual currency, which you can convert into real money and spend with our partners or transfer directly to your bank account. Put on your trainers, synchronise your connected watch and get started - every step counts, every step pays.\r\n\r\nFight the sedentary lifestyle with Macadam. By encouraging and rewarding physical activity, we help you stay fit all while increase your income. Whether you're walking or sprinting, the important thing is to get moving and start earning.\r\n\r\nYour privacy is our priority. Macadam does not use your GPS data and will have no impact on your battery life. What's more, all data is anonymous - we will never sell your information.\r\n\r\nAny questions? Consult our FAQ section to find answers to all your questions about our application.\r\n\r\nMacadam is not affiliated with any other \"walk to earn\" application. We are a single entity, dedicated to rewarding your physical activity.\r\n\r\nGrab your trainers, hit the track or the trails and start turning your steps into cash with Macadam, the step counter that rewards you. Are you walking? We'll reward it! Download Macadam today and start earning money while you stay active.",
